---
import Layout from "../layout.astro";

---
<Layout title="The Path to Financial Freedom | RIPL Wealth" description="Explore Margin, Strategy, Growth, Freedom and Impact: the financial journey and where the RIPL team can help.">
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><h1>Looking for the path to<br><span class="ripl-gold">financial freedom?</span></h1><p class="lead">It starts with something we need from you. Your job is to create margin: money above and beyond what you need to live on day to day. Once you have that, managing it well becomes another full-time job. That’s where our team comes in.</p><div class="page-actions"><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Talk to the Team</a><a class="text-link" href="#freedom-roadmap">Explore the roadmap ↓</a></div></div></section>

<section class="section questions"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="wp" id="freedom-roadmap">
    

    <div class="wp-row left w1"><div class="wp-card"><div class="pm-row"><span class="wp-n">1</span><h3>Margin</h3><span class="pm-badge gold">Yours to accomplish</span></div><p>Create money above and beyond what you need to live on day to day. Make more or spend less, ideally both.</p></div><div class="wp-road"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path class="imp" d="M60 0 C60 30 14 26 14 50 S60 70 60 100"></path><path class="road" d="M60 0 C60 30 14 26 14 50 S60 70 60 100"></path><path class="dash" d="M60 0 C60 30 14 26 14 50 S60 70 60 100"></path></svg><i></i></div><div></div></div>

    <div class="wp-cap"><p>This is where our team comes in.</p></div>

    <div class="wp-row right w2"><div></div><div class="wp-road"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path class="imp" d="M60 0 C60 30 106 26 106 50 S60 70 60 100"></path><path class="road" d="M60 0 C60 30 106 26 106 50 S60 70 60 100"></path><path class="dash" d="M60 0 C60 30 106 26 106 50 S60 70 60 100"></path></svg><i></i></div><div class="wp-card"><div class="pm-row"><span class="wp-n">2</span><h3>Strategy</h3><span class="pm-badge">Where we come in</span></div><p>Create a clear target to aim for and give every dollar a job.</p></div></div>

    <div class="wp-row left w3"><div class="wp-card"><div class="pm-row"><span class="wp-n">3</span><h3>Growth</h3><span class="pm-badge">Where we come in</span></div><p>Grow in a way that brings you closer and closer to your target.</p></div><div class="wp-road"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path class="imp" d="M60 0 C60 30 14 26 14 50 S60 70 60 100"></path><path class="road" d="M60 0 C60 30 14 26 14 50 S60 70 60 100"></path><path class="dash" d="M60 0 C60 30 14 26 14 50 S60 70 60 100"></path></svg><i></i></div><div></div></div>

    <div class="wp-cap gold"><p>Work becomes optional.</p></div>

    <div class="wp-row right w4"><div></div><div class="wp-road"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path class="imp" d="M60 0 C60 30 106 26 106 50 S60 70 60 100"></path><path class="road" d="M60 0 C60 30 106 26 106 50 S60 70 60 100"></path><path class="dash" d="M60 0 C60 30 106 26 106 50 S60 70 60 100"></path></svg><i></i></div><div class="wp-card"><div class="pm-row"><span class="wp-n">4</span><h3>Freedom</h3><span class="pm-badge">Where we come in</span></div><p>You now have financial freedom at your fingertips. If you choose to activate it, your investment business becomes an income stream that helps free up your time.</p></div></div>

    <div class="wp-end">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 900 300" role="img" aria-label="The path opens into ripples spreading outward">
        <path d="M450 0 L450 150" stroke="#C9963A" stroke-width="34" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".9"></path>
        <path d="M450 0 L450 150" stroke="#B8A8E8" stroke-width="12" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
        <ellipse cx="450" cy="170" rx="440" ry="124" fill="none" stroke="#C9963A" stroke-width="1.5" opacity=".35"></ellipse>
        <ellipse cx="450" cy="170" rx="340" ry="96" fill="none" stroke="#C9963A" stroke-width="1.5" opacity=".5"></ellipse>
        <ellipse cx="450" cy="170" rx="240" ry="68" fill="none" stroke="#C9963A" stroke-width="2" opacity=".7"></ellipse>
        <ellipse cx="450" cy="170" rx="140" ry="40" fill="none" stroke="#C9963A" stroke-width="2" opacity=".9"></ellipse>
        <ellipse cx="450" cy="170" rx="56" ry="16" fill="#C9963A"></ellipse>
      </svg>
      <div class="wp-end-copy"><div class="eyebrow">5</div><h2>Impact</h2><p>Our goal is for you to make an impact throughout your career, your business, and your life. Once you achieve financial freedom, new impact doors open for you.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="wp-links"><a class="btn ghost" href="/wealth/">See RIPL Portfolios</a></p>
  <p class="small pm-disc">These are goals, not guarantees. All investing involves risk, including loss.</p>
</div></section>

<section class="section dark"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">THE FIRST STEP WITH US</div><h2>Do you know<br><span class="athlete-gold">your target?</span></h2></div><div><p class="lead">Most people are unaware of what they are actually aiming for. If you don’t know what you’re aiming for, chances are you’re not going to get there.</p><p>Setting a clear target is the first thing we do together.</p><p><a class="text-link" href="/compound-interest-calculator/">Explore time and contributions in the calculator →</a></p><p class="small">The calculator is an illustration. Defining your financial-freedom target requires the full picture of your life.</p><a class="btn athlete-primary" href="/contact/">Talk to the Team</a></div></div></section>

<section class="section"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">THE RIPL EFFECT</div><h2>One thoughtful decision creates a ripple.</h2></div><div><p class="lead">Over time those ripples expand into families, businesses, communities, and generations to create the impact you want to have on the world.</p><p>Take a look at the videos, podcasts, and content we’ve created. It is designed to help you learn and grow, whether you’re ready for some of these steps or not.</p><a class="btn" href="/ripl-effect/">See The RIPL Effect</a></div></div></section>

<section class="final-cta"><div class="wrap"><h2>Ready to find out what is possible when you look at your money differently?</h2><p>One conversation. No obligation. That’s where it starts.</p><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Talk to the Team</a></div></section>


</Layout>
